OL,3,AUS confirms for first time it has
OL,4,Adeployed space weapons
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US has confirmed it deployed a
OL,7,Fspace weapon in Earth's orbit, the
OL,8,Ffirst time it has acknowledged such
OL,9,Foffensive capabilities.
OL,11,FUS Secretary of the Air Force Troy
OL,12,FMeink said the "on orbit" weapon was
OL,13,Fnecessary to safeguard US forces
OL,14,Fagainst hostile enemy action.
OL,16,FSpeaking at the Air, Space and Cyber
OL,17,FConference on Monday, Meink said the US
OL,18,Fwas ready for "evolving threats", but
OL,19,Fdid not elaborate on the weapon's
OL,20,Fcapabilities or when it was put into
OL,21,Forbit.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
