OL,3,AUS confirms for first time it has
OL,4,Adeployed space weapons
OL,5,
OL,6,FSenior military leaders have previously
OL,7,Fsaid they planned to boost military
OL,8,Fcapabilities in space, citing Russian
OL,9,Fand Chinese programmes developing ways
OL,10,Fto attack and disrupt US satellites in
OL,11,Fa future conflict.
